<< /Type /Filespec /AFRelationship /Source /Desc (TeX source) /F (tag-AFfile3781.tex) /UF <FEFF007400610067002D0041004600660069006C00650033003700380031002E007400650078> /EF<</F 22034 0 R/UF 22034 0 R>> >>
